{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703360/extras/e3caadeb556d53d3dbb0c49f88eaf6ec.poster.avif?t=1759881573\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703360/extras/e3caadeb556d53d3dbb0c49f88eaf6ec.webm?t=1759881573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703360/extras/e3caadeb556d53d3dbb0c49f88eaf6ec.mp4?t=1759881573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MARKET DYNAMISM</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DESTABILIZE </strong>A RESIDENTIAL BLOCK WITH <strong>HIGH-GRADE ORDNANCE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE MARKETS RISE, SEEPING BLOOD BETWEEN BLOCKS OF DEBT AND LOGISTICS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and suddenly- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE PRICE OF MEDICINE- OPIATES, IODINE, GAUZE- <u><strong>EXPLODES.</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not evil. You are the God of Nothing- Humanity. An absurd hero.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703360/extras/ca2b8dbdcce3e7f2042086190cd0aef1.poster.avif?t=1759881573\" width=600 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703360/extras/ca2b8dbdcce3e7f2042086190cd0aef1.webm?t=1759881573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703360/extras/ca2b8dbdcce3e7f2042086190cd0aef1.mp4?t=1759881573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>THIS IS THE LATTICE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >not a city. not a prison. <strong>UTOPIA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >it is a meticulously crafted culture dynamo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but it no longer belongs to anyone. it hums on its own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>highs and lows as fuel.</strong> the point is not stability. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the point is acceleration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SELF-SUSTAINING CHAOS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703360/extras/724c7e6562a9b79aab4831dce33ddbda.poster.avif?t=1759881573\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703360/extras/724c7e6562a9b79aab4831dce33ddbda.webm?t=1759881573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703360/extras/724c7e6562a9b79aab4831dce33ddbda.mp4?t=1759881573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KINETIC DEATH DRIVE:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dropkick </strong>walls and enemies to reverse direction and multiply velocity.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roundhouse Kick\u00a0</strong>thrown weapons\u00a0and bullets to redirect them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wallrun</strong> to suppress gravity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walljump</strong> to add lateral speed and override any negative falling velocity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slide</strong> down steep surfaces to build horizontal speed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GUNS ARE VEHICLES TO SALVATION:</strong><